2019s arms by moving every arm pixel up by 2 cells, preserving arm shape and color. 5. In the third (rightmost) frame, raise the arms a further 2 pixels (total of 4 up), and slightly enlarge the mouth by adding one pixel row to the lower lip. 6. Overlay bold white uppercase text \u201cI\u2019M FREEEE\u201d centered just above the puppet\u2019s head only in the third frame. 7. Keep the background bars and all original colors unchanged behind each puppet copy."]}
